      "description": "min(up{job=\"storage2\"}) is Storage2Unreachable's series. The hidden second query reads snmp_exporter's own walk duration, whose *absence* while `up` is 1 is Storage2PollDead's signal — a device that answers but yields no metrics looks healthy on the first number alone.",
